  @3255769: When the task succeeds, close the TaskSpace by default with
  @3255829: `await task.finish({ keep: [] })`. Call `finish()` exactly once and wait for it
  @3255909: to resolve before reporting completion.
  @3255950: `finish()` ends the task and all of its Page labels, including Pages kept for the
  @3256032: user. Put it last in the final round only; do not operate any Page after it in
  @3256111: the same script or in later rounds.
  @3256148: Keeping Pages is a rare exception: retain only necessary Pages when the user
  @3256225: explicitly asks, or when the result must remain in the browser for the user to
