  80: - 监听与访问策略：`const DEFAULT_PORT = 3773`（偏移约 468,229）；默认 URL `http://127.0.0.1:3773`。`localAccessPolicyError()` 与 `isLoopbackHost()` 仅允许 `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` / `::1`；非回环绑定报 `Refusing to bind Ego to non-loopback host ...; remote access has been removed.`；只要存在 `EGO_AUTH_TOKEN`、`EGO_PUBLIC_URL`、`EGO_ALLOW_INSECURE_REMOTE` 之一即启动失败：`<VAR> is no longer supported; Ego only accepts loopback connections.`。`findAvailablePort(preferred)` 在首选端口不可用时回退 `tryReservePort(0)`（系统分配）。[E16]
